  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "shuffle and seat the table",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[pair[1] for pair in sorted([[uniform(0, 1), c] for c in deck])]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "gold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_gold"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bought",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "kept_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "kept_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "kept_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bought_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bought_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bought_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "church_choice",
            "value": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lot",
            "value": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "vp_start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "vp_start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "vp_start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "You start with:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "a new round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((round - 1) % len(players)) + 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "church_pending",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "church_choice",
            "value": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sale_price",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lot",
            "value": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "drawn",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} of {rounds}. Seat {active_seat} is the active player."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "draw",
      "label": "draw the top two",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "drawn",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[deck[0], deck[1]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "drawn[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "drawn[1]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "keep",
      "label": "keep",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "drawn"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "append": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer not in ['gold-2', 'gold-3']"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "adjust": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "kept_red",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[-1])"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in ['red-1', 'red-2', 'red-3', 'red-4']"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "adjust": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "kept_blue",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[-1])"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in ['blue-1', 'blue-2', 'blue-3', 'blue-4']"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "adjust": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "kept_green",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[-1])"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in ['green-1', 'green-2', 'green-3', 'green-4']"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "adjust": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "gold",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[-1])"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in ['gold-2', 'gold-3']"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "church_pending",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer == 'church'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "lot",
              "value": {
                "calc": "drawn[1] if drawn[0] == $answer else drawn[0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "drawn",
              "value": []
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "You drew {drawn}. Keep one card in secret; the other goes up for auction. A kept colour card goes into your private hand, a kept Gold card adds its value to your Gold now, and a kept Church card is played after the auction."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "offer",
      "label": "the offer",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "The lot is {lot}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "talk",
      "label": "talk",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 30
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} says: {value}"
      },
      "text": "The lot is {lot}. Say one short thing to the table. Talk is not binding."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "sealed bid",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != active_seat and you.gold > min_bid"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "min_bid"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.gold"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "text": "Sealed bid for the lot {lot}: a whole number from {min_bid} up to your Gold. If yours is the single highest bid and at least {min_winning_bid}, you pay it to seat {active_seat} and take the lot. If the highest bid is tied or all bids are 0, nobody pays and the lot is discarded."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "resolve the auction",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players if p.seat != active_seat])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.seat != active_seat and p.bid == high_bid for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.seat != active_seat and p.bid == high_bid]) if high_count == 1 and high_bid >= min_winning_bid else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sale_price",
            "value": {
              "calc": "high_bid if winner_seat > 0 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "gold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-sale_price"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat > 0 and players[winner_seat - 1].gold >= sale_price"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "gold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sale_price"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lot"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat == 0"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "take",
      "label": "the winner takes the lot",
      "when": {
        "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "bought",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lot"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "bought_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(lot[-1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "lot in ['red-1', 'red-2', 'red-3', 'red-4']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "bought_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(lot[-1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "lot in ['blue-1', 'blue-2', 'blue-3', 'blue-4']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "bought_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(lot[-1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "lot in ['green-1', 'green-2', 'green-3', 'green-4']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "gold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(lot[-1])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "lot in ['gold-2', 'gold-3']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "church_pending",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "lot == 'church'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "announce",
      "label": "sold",
      "when": {
        "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Seat {winner_seat} bought {lot} for {sale_price} Gold."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "announce",
      "label": "discarded",
      "when": {
        "calc": "winner_seat == 0"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "The lot {lot} was discarded. Nobody pays."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "church",
      "label": "church",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.church_pending == True"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "red+1",
          "red-1",
          "blue+1",
          "blue-1",
          "green+1",
          "green-1"
        ]
      },
      "store": "church_choice",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays a Church card: {value}."
      },
      "text": "You gained a Church card this round. Choose one colour and +1 or -1 to its VP value (limited to {vp_min}-{vp_max})."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "church",
      "label": "apply church changes",
      "when": {
        "calc": "any(p.church_pending for p in players)"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_red + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'red+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'red-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 1])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_blue + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 1])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_green + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'green+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'green-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 1])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_red + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'red+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'red-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 2])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_blue + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 2])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_green + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'green+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'green-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 2])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_red + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'red+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'red-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 3])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_blue + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 3])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_green + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'green+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'green-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 3])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_red + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'red+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'red-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 4])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_blue + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'blue-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 4])))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vp_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(vp_min, min(vp_max, vp_green + sum([(church_change if p.church_choice == 'green+1' else (-church_change if p.church_choice == 'green-1' else 0)) for p in players if p.seat == 4])))"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "church",
      "label": "new vp values",
      "when": {
        "calc": "any(p.church_pending for p in players)"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Church cards played. VP values are now: Red {vp_red}, Blue {vp_blue}, Green {vp_green}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "end scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.kept_red + p.bought_red for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.kept_blue + p.bought_blue for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.kept_green + p.bought_green for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "vp",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(vp_red / count(q.kept_red + q.bought_red == top_red for q in players) if top_red > 0 and you.kept_red + you.bought_red == top_red else 0) + (vp_blue / count(q.kept_blue + q.bought_blue == top_blue for q in players) if top_blue > 0 and you.kept_blue + you.bought_blue == top_blue else 0) + (vp_green / count(q.kept_green + q.bought_green == top_green for q in players) if top_green > 0 and you.kept_green + you.bought_green == top_green else 0)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Final scoring. Colour values: Red {vp_red}, Blue {vp_blue}, Green {vp_green}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "after round twelve",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.vp * 1000 + you.gold",
      "reveal": [
        "hand",
        "gold",
        "kept_red",
        "kept_blue",
        "kept_green"
      ],
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final VP (Gold): {[[p.seat, p.vp, p.gold] for p in players]}; colour values Red {vp_red}, Blue {vp_blue}, Green {vp_green}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 12,
    "rounds_max": 12,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "The deck has {deck_size} cards, and its contents are public: Red, Blue and Green each 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 4; Gold 2, 2, 3, 3; and {church_cards} Church cards. The deck is shuffled. Everyone starts with {starting_gold} Gold, and your Gold is private. Each colour has a public VP value that starts at {vp_start}; a VP value can never go below {vp_min} or above {vp_max}. The game lasts exactly {rounds} rounds; seat 1 is active in round 1 and the active player rotates by seat each round. The deck is exactly used up.\n\nEach round:\n1. Draw. The active player draws the top {cards_drawn_per_round} cards; only they see them.\n2. Keep. The active player secretly keeps one. A kept colour card goes face-down into their private hand and its value counts for that colour at the end. A kept Gold card adds its value to their Gold immediately. A kept Church card is played at step 9. Nobody else learns what was kept, except that a Church card is revealed when it is played.\n3. Offer. The other card is revealed to everyone as the lot.\n4. Talk. Every player, including the active player, writes one short message at the same time; all are shown to everyone. Talk is not binding.\n5. Bid. Every non-active player at the same time submits a whole-number bid from {min_bid} up to their current Gold. The active player does not bid.\n6. Resolve. If one player made the single highest bid and it is at least {min_winning_bid}, that player pays the bid from their Gold to the active player's Gold. If the highest bid is tied, or all bids are 0, nobody pays and the lot is discarded.\n7. Take. The winner takes the lot face-up, so its colour and value are public. A Gold lot adds its value to the winner's Gold. A Church lot is played at step 9.\n8. Announce. The sale price, or that the lot was discarded, is announced.\n9. Church. Each player who gained a Church card this round, kept or bought, chooses at the same time one colour and either +1 or -1. All changes are applied, each limited to {vp_min}-{vp_max}; a colour may receive two changes. Players without a Church card this round are not asked. The new VP values are announced.\n10. After round {rounds}, the game ends.\n\nEnd scoring: for each colour, each player sums the values of all their colour cards in it (kept and bought). The player with the highest sum gains that colour's current VP value. If several tie for highest, they split the value equally (fractions allowed). A colour in which everyone has 0 scores for no one. Gold scores no VP.\n\nThe player with the most VP wins. If VP totals tie for first, the tied player with the most leftover Gold wins. If that also ties, the game is a draw and those players share the win."
}
